%% Sequence Diagram: Parent-Youth Account Management
sequenceDiagram
  participant Parent as Parent/Guardian
  participant WebApp as Banking Web Application (SPA/React)
  participant API as Youth Account APIs
  participant AccountSvc as Account Service
  participant TransSvc as Transaction Service
  participant PaymentSvc as Payment Service
  participant SettingsDB as Youth Account Settings DB

  %% Dashboard Access
  Parent->>WebApp: Login (OAuth2)
  WebApp->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{youthAccountId}/dashboard (Bearer Token)
  API->>AccountSvc: Get Account Details
  API->>SettingsDB: Get Spending Limit
  API->>TransSvc: Get Recent Transactions
  API-->>WebApp: Dashboard Response
  WebApp-->>Parent: Render Dashboard

  %% Fund Transfer
  Parent->>WebApp: Initiate Fund Transfer
  WebApp->>API: POST /api/youth-accounts/{youthAccountId}/fund-transfer
  API->>AccountSvc: Validate Source Account
  API->>PaymentSvc: Initiate Fund Transfer
  API->>AccountSvc: Update Account Balance
  API-->>WebApp: Transfer Response
  WebApp-->>Parent: Show Transfer Status

  %% Update Spending Limit
  Parent->>WebApp: Update Spending Limit
  WebApp->>API: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{youthAccountId}/spending-limit
  API->>SettingsDB: Update Weekly Limit
  API-->>WebApp: Limit Update Response
  WebApp-->>Parent: Show Update Status

  %% Transaction History
  Parent->>WebApp: View Transaction History
  WebApp->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{youthAccountId}/transactions
  API->>TransSvc: Fetch Transaction History
  API-->>WebApp: Transaction History Response
  WebApp-->>Parent: Show Transactions
